              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Koany, eponito apaarasia, eyanaario kere luejaas togokon, ka nul Iuapotu lukapapaakon kinadata kiton lolo, Babulon: ebala EJAKAIT ebe, emameun ibore yenepianun, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
